  _description: The RAIDER side of the barn moral fork (his counter-offer arriving platforms after
    the farmer's bounty, on the shared recurring actor), Shape B (P1-8). Premise holds while the
    farmer's grain is NOT recovered - honoring the bounty (world.grain_recovered) contradicts it and
    the pact retires failed/conflict; the mirror of barn_raid's raider_offer_taken premise. The two
    offers are same-tier, different-currency (facts are the stakes, never loot-EV) and are never
    shown side by side.
